Catherine Sugden: Yeah, so I don't know, like, some of them, it was just, like, and they were kind of… some of them were all over the place, but then others were, like, would come in and book. So, like, we don't want to miss out.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:06:01.000
Catherine Sugden: there. Um, we haven't done a lot of, like, from what I know since when I've been here, that we haven't done a lot of, like, meta ads or anything like that. Um…

