Brittanie: I don't think so Thanks for setting this up I appreciate it.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.000
Whitney Hodges: Thank you.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:12:06.000
Whitney Hodges: Absolutely, yes, yeah, so Katherine and I were just catching up, and, you know, I was letting her know how we're excited to have you guys officially on board with LeadLock, and that makes now a really great time for a conversation to, uh, you know, talk more about, like, the lead generation.

