Whitney Hodges: And, um, we were just kind of catching up a little bit about, like, what the… what the strategy is in general, right? So…

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:40.000
Whitney Hodges: Usually do see that, um, you know, you are going to see the best quality leads, you're going to see, um, you know, the best, um, volume as well, when you are.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.000
Brittanie: Mm-hmm.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:55.000
Whitney Hodges: advertising on both Google and Meta simultaneously, as opposed to one or the other. So, like I mentioned, like, if you have $1,000 a month to spend on your ads, it's actually gonna go farther to split that $1,000 between Google and Meta than it would be to just.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.000
Brittanie: Okay.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:50.000
Brittanie: Yeah, that's the last one, I think.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:55.000
