00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.000
Brittanie: Oh, okay. Mm-hmm.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:13.000
Whitney Hodges: $1,000 on Google. We also talked about Tiktok a bit, and how that platform is so powerful. But what we're really seeing over there do well is more like just focusing on organic, which it sounds like you're maybe kind of doing on the the planning side of your your business. So.

