Brittanie: Yes. Mm-hmm.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:24.000
Whitney Hodges: something for you to kind of keep in mind in terms of, like, overall strategy as well, like, organic on TikTok, but focusing on, like, Google and Meta for paid.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.000
Brittanie: Okay.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:39.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, and then what we were just kind of starting to get into was kind of, like, the actual ad strategy, right? So, for both Google and Meta, what we do recommend is having a long-form landing page.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:27.000
Brittanie: But…

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.000
Brittanie: Okay.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.000
Brittanie: That's what we recommend.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.000
Brittanie: Okay, hold on.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.000
Brittanie: Okay.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:55.000
Whitney Hodges: specifically for your ads traffic, as opposed to sending those users to the full-blown website. Because the website is great, right? And it definitely, like, you know, serves a major purpose when people are researching.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.000
Brittanie: Okay.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.000
Brittanie: Yeah, sure.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.000
Brittanie: Mm-hmm.

