Brittanie: This is what I said before.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.000
Brittanie: Thank you.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.000
Brittanie: Okay.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:52.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah, so the content there is going to look a little different, right? Because that's more content, that's more, like, overcoming objective… objections, that's more, like, talking about your process, and kind of everything that's included, and what sets you apart, um, sort of thing. So, that's kind of the…

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:37.000
Brittanie: Okay.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.000
Brittanie: Mm-hmm.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.000
Brittanie: That's that's being performed.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:54.000
Brittanie: Okay, so that's kind of the overall.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:18:00.000
Whitney Hodges: the overall strategy that we recommend and that we see working well for venues across the country.

